WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Simple Calculator — Project Demo

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Enter two numbers and choose an operation.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Press equals to display the result: 7 plus 8 equals 15.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The calculator also supports multiplication.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The result of 9 multiplied by 6 is 54.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.500
You can also divide numbers.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Press C to clear the display and start again.
